<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Perkin-Elmer upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Perkin-Elmer upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Bros analyst Edward White said in a research note he raised his recommendation on Perkin-Elmer Corp to outperform from neutral.</p>
<p>-- The combination of continued strong performance, a new business model and recent share price weakness &quot;represents an attractive buying opportunity,&quot; the note said.</p>
<p>-- Lehman also set a one-year price target of $80 per share.</p>
<p>-- The shares rose 2-3/8 to 65-1/8 in early New York Stock Exchange trade.</p>
</text>
